  message: "DONE — false-premise / already fixed. The unifying fix (add function+variable to CONTAINABLE_KINDS) shipped in commit 25116a3606 (dispatch:F4 / INV-pohik de-orphan, 2026-06-25), an ancestor of HEAD, 17 days after this item was filed. BEHAVIORAL EVIDENCE (fresh slice of packages/hypergumbo-core/.../linkers, dev 8eef2da94d): 476 file->function + 424 file->variable contains edges emit; CONTAINABLE_KINDS = {method,getter,setter,message,function,variable,field}. The filed 7117/1610 orphan counts no longer reproduce. Regression tests test_span_containment_file_contains_function/_variable guard it. No code work remained; closed under the INV-pohik umbrella."  # 7e8f
